 أحد الأشرار، يُمنح طالبٌ عادي قوةً خارقة تتيح له الالتحاق بأكاديمية ثانوية تُدرِّب الأبطال.","description_en":"Izuku has dreamt of being a hero all his life—a lofty goal for anyone, but especially challenging for a kid with no superpowers. That’s right, in a world where eighty percent of the population has some kind of super-powered \"quirk,\" Izuku was unlucky enough to be born completely normal. But that’s not enough to stop him from enrolling in one of the world’s most prestigious hero academies.","description_fr":"Super héros, super pouvoirs… On a tous déjà rêvé secrètement de posséder une qualité hors du commun, de briller ou d’être LA personne la plus puissante de l’univers. Dans ce nouveau monde, ce rêve est à la portée de quasiment toute la population car les humains peuvent désormais naître avec un pouvoir : le « alter ». Mais certains malchanceux naissent sans alter. C’est très fâcheux si on est chétif, pleurnicheur et dépourvu de charisme et surtout si malgré tout ça, on nourrit l’ambition de devenir le méga super héros de…","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a3GlsRvZx7i1a77IVMxuvR7TZj0.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3ILMlmC30QUnYkY3XEBOyJ82Dqu.jpg","has_poster":true,"rating":8.6,"vote_count":5436,"age_rating":"TV-14","year":"2016","release_date":"2016-04-03","runtime_minutes":24,"status":"Ended","country":"اليابان","language":"اليابانية","genres":["حركة ومغامرة","رسوم متحركة","خيال علمي وفانتازيا"],"genre_keys":["action","animation","scifi"],"similar":["tv57706","tv15260","tv73223","tv51817","tv4686","tv62211","tv44593","tv286791"],"director":null,"cast":[{"name":"دايكي ياماشيتا","character":"Izuku Midoriya (voice)","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/rQNdJdZewk7VGP16ZNbpfJ9ZeMd.jpg"}],"trailer_url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TRr_dS2REo4","seasons_count":8,"episodes_count":170,"all_airings":[{"channel_id":"beINSeries1.qa@SD","start":"2026-11-15T21:00:00Z","stop":"2026-11-15T21:30:00Z","start_ts":1794776400,"st